.* WRKOUTQD: an output queue's description, over two pages; F13
.* prompts CHGOUTQ.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WTRACT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=WTRNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HELD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXPAGES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXSTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXEND CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTOSTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSPDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBSEP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPRCTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTAQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTAQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTCHK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RMTSYS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNOPT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNOBJ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNTYP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SPLFASP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=WIDEST CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/QDKEYS' NAME=QDKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='RETURN 13'.F13=Change
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOUTQD KEYL=QDKEYS HELP=WRKOUTQD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Output Queue Description
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTQ' VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Queue
:DATAIX VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Status
:DATAI HELP='FLD/WTRACT' VAR=WTRACT USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer active
:DATAI HELP='FLD/WTRNAME' VAR=WTRNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer name(s) if active
:DATAI HELP='FLD/HELD' VAR=HELD USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue held
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Maximum spooled file size
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAXPAGES' VAR=MAXPAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of pages
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAXSTR' VAR=MAXSTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Starting time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAXEND' VAR=MAXEND USAGE=OUTPUT.Ending time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/AUTOSTR' VAR=AUTOSTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Writers to autostart
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DSPDTA' VAR=DSPDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Display any file
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBSEP' VAR=JOBSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Job separators
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OPRCTL' VAR=OPRCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Operator controlled
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SEQ' VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Order of files on queue
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DTAQ' VAR=DTAQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Data queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DTAQLIB' VAR=DTAQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/AUTCHK' VAR=AUTCHK USAGE=OUTPUT.Authority to check
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RMTSYS' VAR=RMTSYS USAGE=OUTPUT.Remote system
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDFNOPT' VAR=USRDFNOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.User defined option
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.User defined object
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDFNOBJ' VAR=USRDFNOBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDFNLIB' VAR=USRDFNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDFNTYP' VAR=USRDFNTYP USAGE=OUTPUT.Object type
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SPLFASP' VAR=SPLFASP USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file ASP
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TEXT' VAR=TEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=WIDEST USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Names of the active printers
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOUTQD.Work with Output Queue Description - Help
:P.How an output queue is set up: whether it is held, whether a writer
prints from it, the order of its files and who may see them. F13
prompts the change command for the queue.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/QDKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Change
:PD.Change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OUTQ'.Queue
:P.The queue shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/WTRACT'.Writer active
:P.The writer active shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/WTRNAME'.Writer name(s) if active
:P.The writer name(s) if active shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HELD'.Output queue held
:P.The output queue held shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXPAGES'.Number of pages
:P.The number of pages shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXSTR'.Starting time
:P.The starting time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXEND'.Ending time
:P.The ending time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AUTOSTR'.Writers to autostart
:P.The writers to autostart shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSPDTA'.Display any file
:P.The display any file shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOBSEP'.Job separators
:P.The job separators shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OPRCTL'.Operator controlled
:P.Whether users with job control special authority can control the
queue.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SEQ'.Order of files on queue
:P.The order of files on queue shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTAQ'.Data queue
:P.The data queue, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTAQLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AUTCHK'.Authority to check
:P.Which authority is checked&colon. the owner's, or data authority.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RMTSYS'.Remote system
:P.The remote system, by host name or internet address.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDFNOPT'.User defined option
:P.Options that a user-defined print program can use.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDFNOBJ'.Object
:P.The object shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDFNLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDFNTYP'.Object type
:P.The object type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SPLFASP'.Spooled file ASP
:P.The spooled file ASP shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TEXT'.Text description
:P.The text description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
